1
00:00:00,874 --> 00:00:03,204
(Penny:)and all she did was help
out another scientist,

2
00:00:03,210 --> 00:00:05,880
(Penny:)I'm thinking you might
have to let this one go.

3
00:00:05,879 --> 00:00:07,879
Ugh, "let it go."

4
00:00:07,881 --> 00:00:10,251
(Sheldon:)I have heard that
my whole life.

5
00:00:10,250 --> 00:00:12,420
(Sheldon:)Every time something upsets me
somebody says, "let it go,"

6
00:00:12,419 --> 00:00:13,919
(Sheldon:)you know,
like it's my fault,

7
00:00:13,920 --> 00:00:15,920
(Sheldon:)and it's not okay
to feel the way I feel.

8
00:00:15,922 --> 00:00:17,322
(sighs) I don't know
what to tell you.

9
00:00:17,324 --> 00:00:18,754
(Penny:)I mean, why don't
you talk to her?

10
00:00:18,759 --> 00:00:20,759
(Sheldon:)Is that all you have?

11
00:00:20,761 --> 00:00:23,761
(Sheldon:)Shopworn tidbits like
"talk to her" and "let it go"?

12
00:00:23,764 --> 00:00:25,634
(Sheldon:)Gee, Penny,
life's giving me lemons.

13
00:00:25,632 --> 00:00:26,962
(Sheldon:)What should I do?

14
00:00:26,967 --> 00:00:29,367
(Penny:)Well, you could shove
them somewhere.

15
00:00:31,672 --> 00:00:34,072
(Sheldon:)Okay, now you're
getting creative.

16
00:00:35,375 --> 00:00:37,045
(Barry:)Thanks again
for your help.

17
00:00:37,044 --> 00:00:38,374
(Leonard:)No problem.
Our pleasure.

18
00:00:38,378 --> 00:00:39,848
(Leonard:)The place really
looks great.

19
00:00:39,846 --> 00:00:42,316
(Raj:)Yeah, you should have
burned it down years ago.

20
00:00:42,316 --> 00:00:45,686
(Stuart:)I keep telling you
I didn't burn it down.

21
00:00:45,686 --> 00:00:47,356
(Leonard:)We know, we know--
because burning something down

22
00:00:47,354 --> 00:00:50,254
(Leonard:)for the insurance money
is a "crime."

23
00:00:51,358 --> 00:00:54,428
(Bernadette:)Stuart, this place
looks amazing.

24
00:00:54,428 --> 00:00:55,398
(chuckles)
Thanks.

25
00:00:55,395 --> 00:00:57,665
(Howard:)You really did
a nice job.

26
00:00:57,664 --> 00:01:00,024
(Stuart:)And thank you
for putting up with me

